cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its research artifacts, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SAGE-Credit: Adaptive Expert Gating for Credit Default Prediction Under Variable External-Score Availability"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mundhra
    given-names: Raghav
abstract: >-
  SAGE-Credit is an adaptive gated-expert framework for credit-default
  prediction under changing external-score availability. It combines full
  and score-free CatBoost experts with an applicant-specific neural gate.
keywords:
  - credit risk
  - default prediction
  - missing data
  - CatBoost
  - mixture of experts
  - model robustness
repository-code: "https://github.com/ramundhra/SAGE-Credit"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-15
